	{ String _name = "DSSVTerrainDesc";	String _text = "Arrr, [DSSV] = DS Small Village v2 - New Starting Conditions & New Terrain types info:
																	Lake - A large central lake, with a small amount of useable land around the edge.
																	Plain with Lake - A flat 'Plains' type map, with one river, also a smallish size lake.
																	Plain with no lake -- like above - A flat plains map, but this time, it has no lakes.
																	Mountain Lakes - A difficult, near un-inhabitable map, with large mountain ranges
																	dominating the landscape, an' deep 'loch' like lakes."; }
	]
}

